{"id":"ccbc12:problem:d-p2088","answer":"YUMMY","hints":[{"number":1,"title":"我毫无头绪","html":"<p>如果整个绳串以黄色钉子为轴，向右侧旋转至水平位置，会发生什么呢？</p>","text":"如果整个绳串以黄色钉子为轴，向右侧旋转至水平位置，会发生什么呢？","assetIds":[]}],"additionalAnswers":[],"solution":{"status":"available","format":"text","html":"<p>把绳串水平放置后绳子会受重力自然下垂，象形得到答案：<strong>YUMMY</strong>。</p>\n<p><img alt=\"答案参考\" data-asset-id=\"asset-75c4fa1d140c06357f3db614\" src=\"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/d-2088.jpg\"/></p>\n<p>你也可以查看视频题解： https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JP4y1m7J6</p>","text":"把绳串水平放置后绳子会受重力自然下垂，象形得到答案：\nYUMMY\n。\n\n你也可以查看视频题解： https://www.bilibili.com/video/BV1JP4y1m7J6","refId":null,"assetIds":["asset-75c4fa1d140c06357f3db614"]},"extended":{"html":"","text":"","assetIds":[]},"interactive":{},"sourceMetadata":{"type":"problem"},"failedAssets":[],"assets":[{"id":"asset-75c4fa1d140c06357f3db614","url":"https://archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/d-2088.jpg","path":"data/assets/archive.cipherpuzzles.com/ccbc12/images/answer/d-2088.jpg","mime":"image/jpeg","size":41593,"sha256":"38779101fdcd64c9d66dd6054c24402582248b84e458041dd15eeb1eb05b1ab5","status":"cached","error":"","roles":["solution"],"contexts":["solution"]}]}
